    rdf:value """Monday, Sept. 2, 1907
Pouring.
Quiet day with bath.
Bernhard reached Paris and went to  Laversine , and then went with Lady Sassoon and Mme Lambert to Rouen for the night, motoring.
They saw Les Andelys and Château Gaillard also Gisors."""^^xsd:string ;
    mbdiaries-ontology:index 267 ;
